   "limitations": "Not compared with hardware or an emulator. The runtime view is 320x224, wider than the GBA screen: the HUD keeps its native positions from the view's top-left corner and the minimap is placed 26 pixels from the view's right edge (SCREEN_SIZE_X replaced by the view width). Only the HUD is drawn by the PPU (its OAM slots; the other sprites keep the runtime's own drawing), so the HUD is always in front. Without a save system the minimap progress (gVisitedMinimapTiles, gMinimapTilesWithObtainedItems, downloaded maps) lasts one session; the Hiragana tiles, the debug room info and the boss icon updates by Kraid, Ridley and the ship (MinimapUpdateChunk has no caller yet) are not wired. HudDraw runs after ProjectileUpdate every frame and writes the native OBJ VRAM and OAM of a GbaPpu: sCommonSpritesGfx at VRAM_OBJ + 0x800 and sCommonSpritesPal at OBJ palette rows 2 to 7 (the in-game init), the energy digits and the energy tank row (sEnergyTanksGfx_* by full tanks, the low health flag under 30), the three refill animation stages of the energy, missile, super missile and power bomb counters (gEnergyRefillAnimation and the others, set by the Chozo statue refills), the missile, super missile and power bomb counters composed from 4-pixel digits (sMissileDigitsGfx, sPowerBombDigitsGfx) with their Inactive, Selected or Active symbol (HudUpdateGfx follows gSamusWeaponInfo.weaponHighlighted and missilesSelected), the suitless charge bar, the native escape countdown objects, and the OAM entries of HudUpdateOam (health bar, counters only when their maximum is non-zero, the minimap and its square blinking every 8 frames). The minimap decompresses the area's sMinimapDataPointers map (LZ77), adds the obtained items, hides the unexplored tiles unless the map is downloaded (MinimapSetDownloadedTiles), follows Samus's screen (MinimapCheckForUnexploredTile with the room entry's mapX and mapY read from sAreaRoomEntryPointers), marks it explored, records the area names, and redraws one 3-tile line a frame through the sPauseScreen_40d74c / _40d6fc color tables with the four flips. Checked in brinstar_000 (`--spawn 212 496`): energy 99, missiles, super missiles and power bombs with their symbols, the minimap with the Morph Ball room tile and the blinking square.",
