   "limitations": "The 0x58-byte container entity and its 0x08527048/0x08527354 anchor records fold into fixed per-piece offsets (go_anchor_x/y) and angles; the ten limbs persist as AOS_ROLE_GOLEM_PART* children emitted over the first updates under the 8-child room cap; the 42-case state-0 and ~57-case state-1 choreography collapses to a documented step cycle (idle approach, song-0x7C attack, song-0x7E exit, song-0x80/0x87 rush, return to step 1/6); sub_0808197C/sub_080819C4/sub_0808199C animation stepping, the sub_0806CDB8 distance picks, the sub_0806D0B8 wall probes and the sub_08080F84 mirror fold into player_near/player_in/blocked approximations; the + 0x80/+ 0x84 custom hitbox source is not ported (frame boxes used); the sub_0804277C/sub_080427B8 hurt-box registrations fold into hurt_off children plus the shared body pass; limb damage forwarding (sub_08081248) is not ported; one variant palette bank per id is approximated by the shared 0x0820A6FC bank; and there is no emulator comparison. EnemyGolemCreate (0x0807E508) through sub_08081128 loads tiles 0x081CBFAC/0x081CBFB4, frames 0x08219804 and palette 0x0820A6FC, fills the ten-limb piece tables 0x08118E80..0x08118ECD and the + 0x65 frame bytes, spawns ten limbs through sub_0806DFF8 (callback sub_080812CC) and fills the container anchor records; the dormant gEwramData + 0x8E & 0x40 flag parks state 3 (sub_080809C0). EnemyGolemUpdate (0x0807E35C) gates activity (sub_0806D128(6), bounds sub_08068AD4, hurt sub_08021924, sub_0806AE54), runs sub_0806D4C0 collision and dispatches state 0 sub_0807E8EC, state 1 sub_0807F494, state 2 the in-update death (sub_0806D7F0 debris every fourth tick, + 0x59 bit 8 container delete) and state 3 sub_080809C0. The lethal sub_080811CC flashes, plays song 0x71 and enters state 2 with + 0xD = 0x4A. The limb machine sub_080812CC rides each child on its anchor record, aims + 0x48 (pieces {0,2,7,9} track the player, the others hold their record angle) and detaches into the thrown state on the parent death. Unit-tested in golem_tests. Variant: {2000 hp, contact 47, defence 25, weak 0x0801, resist 0x0000, exp 400; drops rare item 0x0018, yellow soul 8 (routine 0x08032205, ported flag soul); tiles 0x081CBFB4 and the swapped piece order of table 0x08118ECD}.",
